      "text": "(:: requestStatus (-> Int Int Int Int Int Int Int Int Int Int))\n(fn (requestStatus\n      requestIdentifier  ; caller identity\n      responseIdentifier\n      retryLimit\n      timeoutMilliseconds\n      bufferCapacity\n      workerCount\n      queueCapacity\n      maximumPayloadBytes\n      statusCode)\n  statusCode)\n\n(:: main Int)\n(fn (main)\n  ((lambda (requestIdentifier responseIdentifier retryLimit timeoutMilliseconds bufferCapacity\n             workerCount queueCapacity maximumPayloadBytes statusCode) statusCode)\n    1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 42))\n"
